{
  "format": 1,
  "_about": [
    "The system packages and downloaded programs of every install path: the hosted image (scripts/image/customize.sh),",
    "a self-hosted Linux server (scripts/install-linux.sh), the dev environment (scripts/dev-env/srt/install-srt.sh,",
    "scripts/dev-env/install-trial.sh) and an office Mac (scripts/office/office-install.sh). A feature that needs a system",
    "package or a program adds it here, never to one script (docs/REPOSITORY-RULES.md). Read by scripts/system/packages.sh;",
    "checked by tests/unit/system-packages.test.ts. Shipped in every Linux bundle as root/packages.json, a Linux copy",
    "without the darwin platforms (packages.ts linuxList), so a change of what a Linux server reads is a root change",
    "(rootSince) and mycel-ctl update brings a server to it (packages.sh sync); a Mac-only change is not.",
    "groups.<g>.install: always = every install, also --minimal; default = every install unless --minimal, and the image;",
    "on-request = only a script that names the group (image: customize.sh; srt: install-srt.sh and the image; boxes:",
    "install-trial.sh).",
    "Package versions: the distribution release is pinned (distros; the installers accept no other), each package may",
    "carry a floor \">=V\" that is checked after the install (dpkg --compare-versions), and the newest version of that",
    "release is installed, security updates included. A package value is \">=V\", \"\" (any version) or",
    "{\"min\": \">=V\", \"on\": [\"<distro>\" | \"<distro>/<arch>\"], \"when\": \"userns-restricted\"}.",
    "Artifacts are pinned exactly: one version, and a url, sha256 and size for every platform. A new browser: take the",
    "Stable version of last-known-good-versions-with-downloads.json (googlechromelabs.github.io/chrome-for-testing),",
    "download its four chrome-headless-shell zips, and write their sha256 (shasum -a 256) and size here.",
    "Python programs (python, a group's \"python\") are pinned exactly too: the program's version, the Python it needs and",
    "the sha256 of every wheel it installs, written by scripts/system/python-lock.ts from the project's uv.lock. packages.sh",
    "installs them with pip --require-hashes --only-binary :all: --no-deps into a venv of their own in",
    "/opt/trina/python/<name>/<version>-<sha12>, with a link current (pk_python_install)."
  ],
  "distros": {
    "debian-12": { "id": "debian", "version": "12", "suite": "bookworm" },
    "debian-13": { "id": "debian", "version": "13", "suite": "trixie" },
    "ubuntu-24.04": { "id": "ubuntu", "version": "24.04", "suite": "noble" }
  },
  "arches": ["amd64", "arm64"],
  "groups": {
    "core": {
      "install": "always",
      "for": "the sandbox (bwrap), the engine firewall (nft), sysctl (procps), downloads and unpacking. Floors: Debian 12, the oldest release",
      "packages": {
        "bubblewrap": ">=0.8.0",
        "nftables": ">=1.0.6",
        "ca-certificates": ">=20230311",
        "curl": ">=7.88.1",
        "gnupg": ">=2.2.40",
        "file": ">=1:5.44",
        "zstd": ">=1.5.4",
        "util-linux": ">=2.38.1",
        "procps": ">=2:4.0.2",
        "apparmor": { "when": "userns-restricted" }
      }
    },
    "documents": {
      "install": "always",
      "for": "the server's own converters: PDF pages and HEIC photos",
      "packages": {
        "poppler-utils": ">=22.12.0",
        "libheif-examples": ">=1.15.1"
      }
    },
    "media": {
      "install": "always",
      "for": "video and audio the AI reads (ffmpeg, ffprobe)",
      "packages": {
        "ffmpeg": ">=7:5.1"
      }
    },
    "fonts": {
      "install": "default",
      "for": "Korean, Japanese and Chinese in what the browser prints and the dev environment draws; Arial-compatible Latin",
      "packages": {
        "fonts-noto-cjk": "",
        "fonts-liberation": ""
      }
    },
    "devenv": {
      "install": "default",
      "for": "the dev environment's commands and srt (socat, ripgrep). Installing them turns nothing on: install-srt.sh does",
      "packages": {
        "socat": "",
        "ripgrep": "",
        "polkitd": "",
        "jq": "",
        "git": "",
        "xz-utils": "",
        "python3": "",
        "python3-venv": "",
        "python3-pip": "",
        "build-essential": "",
        "chromium": { "on": ["debian-12", "debian-13"] }
      }
    },
    "browser": {
      "install": "default",
      "for": "HTML to PDF (server/src/files/html-pdf.ts): the pinned chrome-headless-shell and the libraries it loads (ldd of the linux64 and linux-arm64 builds on each system)",
      "packages": {
        "unzip": "",
        "libnspr4": "",
        "libnss3": "",
        "libdbus-1-3": "",
        "libexpat1": "",
        "libgbm1": "",
